1
00:00:00,412 --> 00:00:03,082
(Sheldon:)From this moment forward,
we can be roommates...

2
00:00:03,248 --> 00:00:04,998
(Sheldon:)...but we will no longer be friends.

3
00:00:05,458 --> 00:00:07,088
(Leonard:)I'm sorry you feel that way.

4
00:00:07,252 --> 00:00:09,922
(Sheldon:)I don't think you're fully aware
of the ramifications here, Leonard.

5
00:00:10,088 --> 00:00:11,418
[LEONARD SIGHS]

6
00:00:11,589 --> 00:00:13,469
(Leonard:)Why don't you enlighten me?

7
00:00:13,633 --> 00:00:16,343
(Sheldon:)With the friendship clause
of our agreement nullified...

8
00:00:16,511 --> 00:00:18,801
...you're no longer entitled
to accompany me to go swimming...

9
00:00:18,972 --> 00:00:20,852
(Sheldon:)...at Bill Gates' house
should I be invited.

10
00:00:26,354 --> 00:00:27,984
(Howard:)Ooh, that's gotta sting.

11
00:00:31,985 --> 00:00:34,945
(Leonard:)Think, this time tomorrow,
we'll be in Geneva, Switzerland...

12
00:00:35,113 --> 00:00:38,283
(Leonard:)-...for our first Valentine's Day.
-I know.

13
00:00:38,450 --> 00:00:42,450
(Penny:)I went shopping today and bought
special undies for the occasion.

14
00:00:42,620 --> 00:00:45,120
Thermal? Because it's gonna be cold.

15
00:00:45,290 --> 00:00:47,540
(Penny:)Think it through, Leonard.

16
00:00:48,293 --> 00:00:49,623
(Leonard:)-Oh.
-Oh.

17
00:00:49,794 --> 00:00:51,674
[BOTH LAUGH]

18
00:00:51,838 --> 00:00:53,048
[SNEEZING]

19
00:00:53,214 --> 00:00:54,634
(Leonard(Penny sneezes):)Gesundheit.

20
00:00:54,799 --> 00:00:59,019
(Leonard(Penny sneezes):)Or as they say in Switzerland,
gesundheit.

